/* Whole-compiler canonical CSG facts (dispatch_min full closure) measure
   ~178 MB of text over ~7.8M word records; the small-fixture budgets pinned
   in cold_chengcsg_format.h reject them before decode.  Raise the reader
   rails to twice the observed closure size so the production reader consumes
   what the production writer emits; the header keeps its conservative
   defaults for fixtures that pin the small values. */
