/* libc pthread_create on the linkerless x86_64 path. ABI:
   rdi = out (pthread_t*), rsi = attr (ignored), rdx = start_routine, rcx = arg.
   We mmap a 16MB child stack + a 4096-byte handle page, then reuse the native
   thread_start (clone/handle/state-machine) sequence with the stack-size
   immediates bumped 1MB -> 16MB, write the handle pointer to *out and return 0
   on success (nonzero on allocation/clone failure). The handle pointer is the
   opaque pthread_t consumed by pthread_join/pthread_detach below. */
